 shout out for  Karthik ready  so Karthik  out Lilly you improved Lilly  congratulations  so Karthik thank you so much for writing  the encouraging kind words it really  does mean a lot to me so thank you and  thank you guys and I'll see you very  very soon for another episode of  unlocking Lilly thank you and love you  all
 

